    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A hard-boiled private eye finds herself stranded in a forgotten corner of New Mexico after following a mysterious paranormal lead. All seems lost until the case finds her instead - and once the truth is revealed, there's nothing holding back the lusty desires of the dead.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198120/extras/c7c4be6dc5e1b15f1253fc6e20191d00.webp?t=1747365327\" width=616 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathblossom</strong> is an action / kinetic novel hybrid about love and mortality. Enjoy visual novel-style written scenes and high-octane top-down action as you shoot, kick and blast your way through an erotic revenge thriller! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198120/extras/ab734973bb9b9d91146733e95444fcae.poster.avif?t=1747365327\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198120/extras/ab734973bb9b9d91146733e95444fcae.webm?t=1747365327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198120/extras/ab734973bb9b9d91146733e95444fcae.mp4?t=1747365327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Deathblossom, get ready to: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>fully illustrated story</strong> by Zoquete </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach a <strong>variety of lewd scenes</strong> with different situations, noncon and occasional bondage  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>custom SFX </strong>mixed with the help of the OpenNSFW project </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your revolver and <strong>kick some undead ass in bullet time</strong> with challenging but accessible action gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>supernatural Western noir setting</strong> with existential themes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a colorful cast of <strong>period-inspired characters</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't forget the spectacular soundtrack by the underground musicians of Newgrounds: featuring <strong>Creo, Tanger, JamesHeart, Demonicity, AriaLowo, the Lemons,</strong> and many more amazing artists!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There's no going back from a deal with Death itself.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If\u00a0you enjoyed this free project and want to get some behind-the-scenes content, consider buying the supporter pack, available as DLC on Steam!</strong> This is an optional way to support the solo developer if you want to see more fun, unique NSFW projects in the future. Thank you for your support and enjoy the game!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198120/extras/d5062da3a26fdbc16715777cac2e33e3.avif?t=1747365327\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p>",
